NOTICE
======

This repository includes clean-room TypeScript ports of modules from the
following third-party project:

  Project:   Craft Anything (storytold/craft-anything)
  Source:    https://github.com/storytold/craft-anything
  Commit:    fc93bd091e7810e08b540a67487e3bf5f2b7da2b
  License:   MIT OR Apache-2.0
  Copyright: ArtCraft Team (2026)

Ported modules (crates/formats/src, crates referenced by the license files
MIT and LICENSE-APACHE in the upstream repository):

  - unreal_iostore.rs -> src/parsers/unreal/iostore-parser.ts
    (Unreal Engine IoStore .utoc/.ucas container reader; extended beyond the
    upstream module with chunk extraction and Zip Slip protection)

  - unreal_texture.rs -> src/parsers/unreal/utexture-parser.ts
    (UE 4.26-4.27 cooked package summary and Texture2D export reader)

  - pixels.rs         -> src/parsers/texture/pixel-layouts.ts
    (uncompressed and DXT/BC4/BC5 pixel layouts to RGBA)

  - bptc.rs           -> src/parsers/texture/bptc.ts
    (BC7 and BC6H block decoders, following the Khronos Data Format
    Specification; the upstream test vectors derived from the specification
    are ported to tests/unreal-texture.test.ts)

These are independent re-implementations written from the upstream sources
and the specification; the upstream project's license terms (MIT OR
Apache-2.0) apply to the ported logic. The full license texts are available
in the upstream repository (LICENSE-MIT, LICENSE-APACHE).
